0.489	step	node tools/test_enclosure_points.mjs 	Native palisade heads retain total height, outward normals, open gates and every legacy flat fence (T-2380)
0.101	step	node tools/check_bank_decal_depth.mjs 	The working bank never hides the timber standing on it (T-2098)
0.536	step	node tools/check_onsite_tour.mjs 	The on-site tour walks Prairie Avenue to the Glessner House in Window mode: stops where their parcels put them, in order, arrival by the fix's accuracy, a fix off its ground held (T-3674)
0.103	step	node tools/test_bug_report.mjs 	Crash reports and Report a bug write only what the bugs rule allows, only from the live hosts, a crash once, and cap their emails (T-3743)
1.262	step	node tools/test_navigator.mjs 	The Navigator docks, opens and snaps between its heights, Home reads the street, the target and the Jaunt, and its rail registers ten apps at most that come and go with their context (T-2617, T-2618)
0.121	step	node tools/test_work_audio.mjs 	1812 work impacts require real dated visible contacts and release stale audio safely (T-3551)
0.064	step	node tools/test_nav_jaunts.mjs 	Navigator Jaunts app: Jaunts · Go to · Free roam, the Welcome card's list and search lent and handed back, Home's choices open their segment (T-2630)
0.101	step	node tools/test_keyboard_ownership.mjs 	Focused menus own arrows and Space while world controls and card closing remain available (T-3658)
0.343	step	node tools/test_claim_value.mjs 	The building card prints no '[object Object]' and no other year's law (T-2609)
0.869	step	node tools/test_walker_passage.mjs 	a visitor walks through a building's modelled passage where it clears the eye (T-2943)
0.626	step	node tools/test_house_passages.mjs 	Glessner's court and side doors, and every built 1904 front door, open and shut as people pass, up and down their stairs (T-3524, T-3554)
10.070	selftest	node tools/check_far_slot_field.mjs --self-test 	the slot field check refuses a stream salt one bit off, a swapped sub-grid and a narrow tile
0.410	step	python3 tools/test_human_normal_probe_math.py 	Packed normal frame recovery preserves raw target limits and refuses invalid frames
5.849	step	python3 tools/test_human_maid_1904.py 	A 1904 house maid's dress is sourced, layered and skinned on the shared rig (T-3448)
0.710	step	node tools/test_human_sole_contact.mjs 	Loaded human sole contacts preserve named limb identity and require gait metadata
0.061	step	node tools/lay_driven_1871.mjs --check 	1871's Sunday wagons go round their blocks as lay_driven_1871.mjs writes them, on streets their turns fit (T-3690)
0.523	step	python3 tools/derive_doors_1812.py --check 	Each 1812 building's doors are where its model draws the leaf, and where one who answers stands (T-3463)
1.396	step	python3 docs/RESEARCH/people-1812-town/place_town.py --check 	The 1812 town's people (Kinzie, Lalime, the officers, women, children, Potawatomi and Miami) are what place_town.py writes from their day readings, every indoor span at a building with a door (T-3463..T-3467)
